/*
:name: spec_syntax_destructure_arity
:type: error
*/
// docs 03-bundle.md (tuple on the left-hand side): "mut (c,d) = 1      // error: 2 entry tuple
// in lhs, same in rhs". An unnamed destructuring binds by position (qa.md Appendix §8), so the
// slot count must match the right-hand side; a scalar is not broadcast to every slot.
mut (c, d) = 1   // locate_error_here
cassert(c == 1)
cassert(d == 1)
